# REST Client (VS Code / compatible HTTP client). Run requests in order.
# Synthetic local account only. Change the email if you repeat registration.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@email = synthetic-demo@example.test
@password = Synthetic-Demo-Password1!

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Login: the returned accessToken is an opaque Identity bearer token, not a JWT.
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Create a project
# @name project
POST {{base}}/api/projects/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Synthetic campus","description":"Hourly energy quality checks"}

### Import a raw CSV body (not multipart)
# @name dataset
POST {{base}}/api/projects/{{project.response.body.id}}/datasets?filename=hourly-energy.csv
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../samples/hourly-energy.csv

### Queue analysis. Change key when changing dataset or date range.
# @name job
POST {{base}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: synthetic-analysis-1

{"datasetId":"{{dataset.response.body.id}}","startDate":"2026-01-01","endDateExclusive":"2026-01-03"}

### Poll until succeeded
GET {{base}}/api/jobs/{{job.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Read daily results
GET {{base}}/api/jobs/{{job.response.body.id}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Download CSV (empty consumption cell means no measurements)
GET {{base}}/api/jobs/{{job.response.body.id}}/result.csv
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Filter and paginate jobs
GET {{base}}/api/jobs?status=succeeded&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Search owned projects
GET {{base}}/api/projects/?search=campus&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
